    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie\n\nSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are delighted to present to the market Agricultural lands at Rossarrell, Glaslough, Co. Monaghan.\n\nExtending to approximately 16.17 acres (6.54 HA), this substantial holding comprises a mature woodland offering excellent potential for conservation, recreational use and a long-term investment.\nThe lands enjoy a idylic wooded setting perfect for a log cabin (subject to planning). The location is conveniently located just off the road to Glaslough Village. \n\nThe property represents a great opportunity to acquire a sizeable woodland holding in a highly regarded location, benefiting from good road frontage and easy accessibility. Whether as an addition to an existing landholding or a strategic investment, these lands offer considerable appeal.\n\nMaps available upon request."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total lands: 6.54 HA (16.17 Acres) approximately</li><li>Mature woodland</li><li>Attractive investment opportunity</li><li>Peaceful rural setting</li><li>Conveniently located close to Glaslough Village</li><li>Easy access to Monaghan Town and the N2 road network</li><li>Suitable for forestry, recreational or conservation purposes</li><li>Potential for future timber harvesting (subject to management and regulations)</li><li>Rich natural habitat supporting local wildlife</li><li>Scenic countryside location </li><li>Accessible holding with road frontage</li><li>Ideal addition to an existing farm enterprise</li><li>Super opportunity to acquire a substantial woodland holding in North Monaghan</li><li>Located in a sought-after rural Glaslough area</ul>"
      },
